      "explanation": "[Pt(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>Cl<sub>2</sub>] is dsp<sup>2</sup> hybridisation and shows geometrical\nisomerism.\n<br><br>[Ni(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>2</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> is  Octahedral, show\ngeometrical isomerism.\n<br><br>[Ni(en)<sub>3</sub>]<sup>2+</sup> is Octahedral and shows optical\nisomerism.\n<br><br>[Ni(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>Cl<sub>2</sub>] is sp<sup>3</sup> hybridisation and tetrahedral complex, therefore does not show geometrical and optical isomerism and structural isomerism.\n<br><br>"
